const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"有限到期日让估值问题更清楚",en:"Finite maturity sharpens the valuation question"},body:{zh:"Xiong与Yu研究一批深度价外的认沽权证。与无限期存在的股票不同，权证有明确到期日和行权条款，标的股票价格又可公开观察。这些特征帮助约束基础价值，但不意味着任何衍生品的合理价值都能轻易确定。",en:"Xiong and Yu study deeply out-of-the-money put warrants. Unlike indefinitely lived shares, these instruments have specified expiry and exercise terms, with observable underlying stock prices. These features constrain valuation without making every derivative's fundamental value obvious."},reference:{url:"https://www.princeton.edu/~wxiong/papers/warrant.pdf",label:{zh:"2011年期刊版 · pp. 2723–2724",en:"2011 journal article · pp. 2723–2724"}}},{title:{zh:"模型估值与制度上界互相对照",en:"Compare model values with institutional bounds"},body:{zh:"作者不只依赖Black-Scholes估值，还用当时标的价格跌幅限制与行权价构造更少依赖模型的上界。不同方法共同帮助识别异常定价。若换了合约、行权比例或价格限制，必须重新推导边界，不能直接移用原文阈值。",en:"The authors supplement Black–Scholes values with bounds using historical stock-price limits and strike prices. Different approaches strengthen the valuation comparison. New contracts, exercise ratios or trading limits require re-deriving the bounds rather than copying thresholds."},reference:{url:"https://www.princeton.edu/~wxiong/papers/warrant.pdf",label:{zh:"2011年期刊版 · p. 2724",en:"2011 journal article · p. 2724"}}},{title:{zh:"权证与股票的交易制度不同",en:"Warrants and stocks had different trading rules"},body:{zh:"研究时期的权证允许T+0回转交易，而股票适用T+1；两者交易成本和价格限制也不同。比较换手率时必须带上这些制度差异，否则可能把交易机会更多造成的活跃，完全解释为投资者观点或信息的变化。",en:"During the study, warrants allowed T+0 resale while stocks used T+1; costs and price limits also differed. Turnover comparisons need these institutional details. More frequent trading opportunities should not be attributed entirely to changing beliefs or information."},reference:{url:"https://www.princeton.edu/~wxiong/papers/warrant.pdf",label:{zh:"2011年期刊版 · p. 2727",en:"2011 journal article · p. 2727"}}},{title:{zh:"价格偏离不意味着套利可执行",en:"A price deviation does not establish executable arbitrage"},body:{zh:"论文将卖空约束与异质信念共同纳入解释。即便投资者认为价格过高，也未必能卖空获利；买方则可能期待转卖给后来更乐观的人。理解这种机制需保留可交易性约束，而不是只展示价格与估值之间的差额。",en:"The explanation combines short-sale constraints with heterogeneous beliefs. An investor who sees overvaluation may be unable to short it, while a buyer may anticipate resale to a more optimistic participant. A price–value gap alone omits the constraints on trading it."},reference:{url:"https://www.princeton.edu/~wxiong/papers/warrant.pdf",label:{zh:"2011年期刊版 · pp. 2725, 2728",en:"2011 journal article · pp. 2725, 2728"}}},{title:{zh:"最后交易日与行权结束不是同一天",en:"Last trading and exercise expiry are different dates"},body:{zh:"原文指出权证最后交易日之后仍有行权期间。交易剩余时间与行权剩余时间因此不是同一个字段。整理历史材料时，应分别保存最后交易日、行权窗口、行权价与比例，避免把最后成交价误当成到期支付。",en:"The article distinguishes the last trading day from the subsequent exercise period. Time left to trade is not time left to exercise. Preserve both dates, the strike and exercise ratio; the final market price is not the contract's terminal payoff."},reference:{url:"https://www.princeton.edu/~wxiong/papers/warrant.pdf",label:{zh:"2011年期刊版 · pp. 2723–2725",en:"2011 journal article · pp. 2723–2725"}}},{title:{zh:"高换手是证据的一部分，不是独立判据",en:"High turnover is evidence, not a standalone test"},body:{zh:"作者把高换手、波动、有限期限和价值边界放在一起分析，而不是仅凭成交热度定义泡沫。编辑建议同时保存权证和标的行情、流通数量及合约变化；普通A股日线不足以提供这些材料，成交量还需要配合当时可交易数量解释。",en:"The analysis combines turnover and volatility with finite maturity and valuation bounds. Editorial application: retain warrant and underlying prices, float and contract changes. Ordinary A-share daily bars do not supply that evidence, and volume needs the contemporaneous tradable quantity as context."},reference:{url:"https://www.princeton.edu/~wxiong/papers/warrant.pdf",label:{zh:"2011年期刊版 · pp. 2724–2726",en:"2011 journal article · pp. 2724–2726"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"论文研究2005—2008年的中国认沽权证，涉及特定历史制度和到期条款。不能把其规则当成当前股票或期权规则，也不能从活跃成交直接判定今天某个资产存在泡沫。",en:"The paper concerns Chinese put warrants in 2005–2008 under specific historical rules and expiry terms. Those rules are not current stock or option rules, and heavy trading alone does not diagnose a present-day bubble."}};export{e as default};
